   134	
   135	```mermaid
   136	flowchart LR
   137	  subgraph NODE["every node carries five things, so it can be run, checked and resumed without asking anyone"]
   138	    direction TB
   139	    T["TOOLS: what the agent uses, each proved working.<br/>plus role, engine, exact model and effort, never a default"]
   140	    C["CONTEXT: exactly what the agent is given, and what is withheld.<br/>a verifier never sees the worker's reasoning"]
   141	    K["CONTRACT: the intent, the observable stop condition, what comes<br/>back and in what shape, what may and must not change"]
   142	    E["EVIDENCE: the proof that comes back with the result, and the file<br/>it is saved in. a verifier reads the evidence, never the reasoning"]
