   202	### 3.3 List all the unclear spots before resolving any
   203	
   204	For each spot record:
   205	
   206	| | |
   207	|---|---|
   208	| Kind | missing **information** → a research piece · a **decision** → ask EJ · **unknown** → a bounded explore loop |
   209	| Blocks | which steps cannot start until it is resolved; everything else can start |
   210	| Depends on | another spot whose answer might remove or change this one |
   211	
   212	Questions for EJ go out as one batch, each with a provisional assumption so it can be answered in a few words.
   213	In a prompt file a provisional assumption stands unless EJ corrects it; a workflow design's questions are answered
   214	before the designed workflow runs, except blueprint questions, which hold back only the pieces that build on them.
   215	Blueprint questions are the exception in a prompt file too: they need an explicit
   216	answer before any step that builds on them runs (3.1, blueprint check). Where spots are resolved separately, one
   217	joining step compares the answers. A contradiction is a stop: pick one and say why, never average.
   218	
