   242	
   243	### 3.5 Clear pieces run as loops
   244	
   245	While the unclear spots are being resolved, the pieces that are already clear and not blocked run as loops: a
   246	defined output, the agent attempts, the check runs, pass → close the loop, fail → the feedback goes back to the agent.
   247	
   248	A piece is loop-ready only if it has all five:
   249	
