    89	| code review | no | maker–checker, fresh blind session | risk-tiered: Sonnet 5.5 when nothing builds; different kind from the worker when it builds (EXECUTOR_KINDS rule 5) | fixed checklist; findings with file:line | plant a known defect → the reviewer must find it |
