     1	#!/usr/bin/env python3
     2	"""design_gate.py — the script layer of the default-first design rule (docs/TASK_TYPES.md).
     3	
     4	Deterministic checks on a workflow design JSON. Judgment is NOT done here: the second layer is a
     5	fixed-checklist reviewer (Sonnet 5.5; a different kind from the designer when the design builds or is
     6	high-risk). The category table's single source is docs/TASK_TYPES.md — parsed here, never copied.
     7	
     8	Findings are named:
     9	  G1 category unknown
    10	  G2 category-vs-facts guard (wrong category is a stop, not a repair; "others" is exempt)
    11	  G3 node rules: a check, the five things, loops with limit+exit+feedback
    12	  G4 edges: needs must exist, no cycles, pipeline name valid
    13	  G5 challenger: claim >= 20%, arithmetic matches the estimates, coverage equal to the default
    14	  G6 a design with building nodes carries a reviewer; single-kind builders get a different-kind reviewer
    15	  G7 ledger rows carry every field the reconciliation needs
    16	  G8 labels agree: the design's categories equal the categories its nodes carry (method 3.2: the piece
    17	     labels replace the provisional category, so a claimed category no node carries, or a node category
    18	     the design does not claim, means the relabelling did not happen; the in-run `code review` node that G6
    19	     requires is exempt from the second direction)
    20	
    21	Usage:
    22	  design_gate.py design.json [--types PATH]
    23	  design_gate.py --ledger-row row.json [--types PATH]
    24	  design_gate.py --self-test
    25	Exit: 0 no findings, 1 findings, 2 usage error.
