   268	### 3.6 The rest is a graph
   269	
   270	When the spots are resolved and the clear loops have closed, the algorithm is fully defined:
   271	
   272	- nodes = right-sized pieces (a node may hold its own loop);
   273	- edges = "this piece needs that piece's result";
   274	- gates = a result is verified before anything that depends on it starts;
   275	- a joining node where branches meet.
